    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33198" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφόρ-ιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which the earth
			produces</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.198
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				25.19
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Milet.</u>
				3.149
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.237
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>payment assessed on produce</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκάτη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1345b33
			</span></i>; esp. <i>rent paid in kind</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀπότακτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PAmh.</u>
					2.87
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				377.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				669.30
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
